--- !u!114 &709768341
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 709768339}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dfed72359d4becc46be82e3b1031d364, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sceneObjectives: 
  cameraSize: 15
  isIndoors: 1
  bossBarScript: {fileID: 835332121}
  largeRoomCamera: {fileID: 709768340}
  forceFieldAnimator: {fileID: 1525899507}
  enableDialogue: 1
  enterScript:
  - name: Andaroz
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 84576f8d311d9f940b076c145c4ddd03, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Well well well. And here I thought the Shrieking Valkyries were good soldiers.
      Guess they were a bunch of pushovers.
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "At first I had conflicting feelings about killing you but now I\u2019m really
      not gonna feel bad about this."
  - name: Andaroz
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 84576f8d311d9f940b076c145c4ddd03, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Awww, throwing another tantrum. Reminds me of when you were a good for nothing
      brat.
    - "Regardless, I can\u2019t wait to see you pathetically struggling against MY
      NEW POWER!"
  stage2Script:
  - name: Andaroz
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 84576f8d311d9f940b076c145c4ddd03, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Ha ha\u2026 This can\u2019t actually be happening\u2026 I\u2019m supposed
      to be the strongest\u2026"
    - "NO. I WON\u2019T LET IT HAPPEN!!!"
  endScript:
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - You seem a little pumped about what you just did.
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - HAHA OF COURSE!
    - "I\u2019ve been waiting to bury that trash 6 feet under for a long time now."
  bossTheme: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38e4e2df80a3be444ad4bd59ae1ee5cf, type: 3}
